  "id": "X8s1",
  "description": "One entry per species (sw d1e198a, user 15 Oct) against the same engine with it off, on two forts as built at embark: the small savage lake (V75_SMALLSAV, straddles 3 region tiles: the case the TR2 measurement says matters most) and the good coast (V75_GOOD, 1 site tile, 6 draw tiles). Spring to the end of autumn, one replicate per arm. Expect with it on: no species with more than one open surface entry; walkers' share of land waves up and fliers' and DF-multi-stocked species' (kakapo on 6 tiles, ravens) down; cast coverage up on the ground; in-cast odds then follow FREQUENCY alone (the ladder's spread stays: fix 2, on hold).",
  "needs": "sw-wt/plugin d1e198a scripts deployed; V75_SMALLSAV, V75_GOOD .preverify",
  "reps": 1,
  "until": "season:3",
  "chunk": 20000,
  "pairs_every": 3000,
  "save_chunks": true,
  "sustain": true,
  "recorder": true,
  "ledger_live": true,
  "perf": true,
  "state_every_chunk": true,
  "restart_each_cell": true,
  "receipts": [
   {
    "cmd": "seasonal-wildlife cast status",
    "expect": "season casts on",
    "name": "casts on"
   },
   {
    "cmd": "seasonal-wildlife cast status",
    "expect": "^\\s+ground\\s+Summer\\s+\\d+\\+\\d+\\s+seed",
    "name": "v7.5 casts: a land-ground cast for summer"
   },
   {
    "cmd": "seasonal-wildlife cast status",
    "expect": "^\\s+flying\\s+Summer\\s+\\d+\\+\\d+\\s+seed",
    "name": "a land-flying cast for summer"
   },
   {
    "cmd": "seasonal-wildlife cast status",
